WEBVTT

00:21:57.293 --> 00:22:00.809
And what do you think it would mean
to Arabic speakers and thinkers

00:22:00.809 --> 00:22:02.418
and scientists everywhere?

00:22:02.418 --> 00:22:04.558
So, I think I know

00:22:04.558 --> 00:22:09.172
that the Arabic language on the web
has not that much content,

00:22:09.172 --> 00:22:13.803
but what we are trying to do
is also providing more means

00:22:13.803 --> 00:22:17.292
for people to be able 
to access other languages

00:22:17.292 --> 00:22:21.900
through the language processing aspect 
that I mentioned related to ICT.

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:26.334
I think the relationship with TED, 
it's a very important platform

00:22:26.334 --> 00:22:29.519
to provide those thinkers, 
that young generation,

00:22:29.519 --> 00:22:32.885
those potential entrepreneurs, innovators